<title>NEW ZEALAND: NMFM Asia to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>NMFM Asia to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>NMFM Asia Investments Ltd said on Wednesday it would undertake an on-market buyback of up to four million shares, about 10 percent of fully-paid shares on issue, and seek shareholder approval to purchase up to 20 percent of its fully-paid ordinary shares over a 12-month period.</p>
<p>The company said it would buy back shares on the Australian and New Zealand stock exchanges through broker J.B. Were and Son.</p>
</text>
